note fuel_for: a for over a scalar name with no bound has fuel 1000000 (front.om fe_lfor, omc SF_VAL): the
note pass with i = 1000000 traps 4 (exit 104); a lowering with one pass more writes the line below first.
text hit "pass 1000001\n"
fn main to int
n = ulong 2000000
s = ulong 0
for i ulong n
if eq i 1000000
k = write 1 hit 0 len hit
end
s = add s 1
end
ret int and s 255
end
